WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
You have a bacterial infection in your throat.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Take your medicine and drink more water.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
How long should I take the antibiotics?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Take them twice a day for one week.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Should I stay home from work?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
You should rest until the fever is gone.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
I feel exhausted and a little dizzy.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
That can happen when your body fights an infection.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Come back if you do not feel better.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Thank you for explaining everything.
